INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Sith advanced study I: desire and deliberate choice','sith-advanced-desire','Distinguish a desire from a decision. A desire is an experience; a decision is an action for which you accept responsibility. Examine a recurring ambition by recording its triggers, expected rewards, costs and alternatives. Over seven days, choose one constructive action that serves your long-term goal rather than its immediate emotional reward.

Assessment: explain a situation in which refusing an impulse increased your freedom. Evaluate your evidence and identify a limitation of your interpretation.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='order-of-the-sith' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Sith advanced study II: power and its limits','sith-advanced-power','Power can mean skill, resources, influence or the capacity to act. These are distinct from control over another person''s choices. Examine how dependence on recognition can undermine autonomy. Choose a skill to develop, establish a baseline and measure improvement over four weeks.

Assessment: distinguish competence from status, and explain how your achievement respects the rights of others.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='order-of-the-sith' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Jedi advanced study I: attention and equanimity','jedi-advanced-equanimity','Equanimity is the capacity to respond thoughtfully without requiring every experience to be pleasant. It does not mean suppressing grief or anger. Practice five minutes of comfortable seated attention, noticing sensations without judging them. Stop if the exercise becomes distressing.

Assessment: describe how attention changed a decision, and distinguish observation from interpretation.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='jedi-temple' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Jedi advanced study II: compassion and boundaries','jedi-advanced-boundaries','Compassion recognizes another person''s suffering without requiring unlimited access to your time, body or resources. Study the difference between helping, rescuing and enabling. Design a modest voluntary service project with a clear boundary and a way to evaluate its usefulness.

Assessment: explain how a compassionate refusal can be more responsible than an unwise agreement.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='jedi-temple' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Meditation methods for both living orders','force-meditation-methods','Three optional methods: focused attention on ordinary breathing, open observation of thoughts, and written reflection. Jedi practice may emphasize awareness and compassion; Sith practice may emphasize motivation and agency. Neither requires breath retention, deprivation or altered states. Begin with short sessions and adapt to comfort. Meditation is not a substitute for medical or psychological care.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='force-studies' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Sith alchemy: fictional tradition and symbolic transformation','sith-alchemy-symbolism','Legends portrays Sith alchemy as supernatural alteration of living beings and materials, including in Tales of the Jedi. Such abilities belong to fiction. In a living symbolic practice, alchemy can represent transformation through study, craftsmanship and disciplined habit. Keep a record of a skill before and after practice; identify the actual causes of change rather than attributing results to supernatural certainty.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='order-of-the-sith' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Jedi symbolism: light, the circle and the temple','jedi-symbolic-language','Light can symbolize understanding rather than moral perfection. A circle can represent continuity and interdependence; a temple can represent a place dedicated to study. These are proposed interpretive symbols, not claims about official Jedi iconography. Create an original personal emblem and explain its meaning without assuming others must share it.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='jedi-temple' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Sith symbolism: flame, shadow and the broken chain','sith-symbolic-language','Flame can symbolize ambition and transformation; shadow can symbolize neglected aspects of experience; a broken chain can represent release from limiting habits. These are proposed Knightfall interpretations. A symbol is a reminder of commitments, not evidence of rank or supernatural power. Design an original emblem and explain how it relates to a constructive goal.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='order-of-the-sith' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Marka Ragnos','character-marka-ragnos','Continuity: Legends. Marka Ragnos is an ancient Sith ruler whose death frames the succession conflict in The Golden Age of the Sith. His legacy illustrates how political legitimacy can outlast a ruler and become contested by successors. Compare the original comic portrayal with later Legends references; do not assume identical details in Canon.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Ludo Kressh','character-ludo-kressh','Continuity: Legends. Ludo Kressh opposes Naga Sadow during the ancient Sith succession crisis. Their disagreement provides a fictional contrast between caution and expansion. Read The Golden Age of the Sith and The Fall of the Sith Empire as a connected narrative, noting how each character''s ambitions shape his judgment.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Satele Shan','character-satele-shan','Continuity: Legends. Satele Shan is a Jedi Grand Master in Star Wars: The Old Republic. Her story is situated in a period of conflict between the Republic and Sith Empire. Use the game''s class and expansion narratives as continuity-specific sources. Consider the tensions between institutional responsibility, personal relationships and wartime leadership.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Yoda','character-yoda','Continuity: Canon and Legends, with distinct histories. Yoda is a senior Jedi leader in the prequel films and Luke''s teacher in the original trilogy. The Clone Wars explores his relationship with the Force and the limits of institutional knowledge. Compare his advice across different stages of his life, especially the consequences of failure and the possibility of learning from it.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';